      <LongDescription>The &lt;noparse&gt;SGM-H-300 BFR&lt;/noparse&gt; is a size 3 direct guidance missile.  It is based on the SGM-H-3 body, which is a high speed hybrid missile designed to strike heavy targets.  This missile will deliver a $MISSILEWARHEAD_DETAIL_BLASTFRAG warhead.  It homes in on its target using command guidance from its launching ship.

